# An app load for memory checks on the PC (xnuhost --input-script FILE; format: src/input_script.c): after the boot,
# tap each place of the Home Screen's first page, give the app time to open under qemu, go Home, and the next one.
# The same load for a before and an after run. The axes are input-demo.script's (a 1440 x 3120 panel); the places
# are a 4 x 6 grid and the dock at the proportions of iOS's Home Screen on a 6.9-inch iPhone (not measured on a
# screenshot: a place with no icon opens nothing, which costs only its wait).
abs 0x2f 0 9             # ABS_MT_SLOT
abs 0x39 0 65535         # ABS_MT_TRACKING_ID
abs 0x35 0 1439 10       # ABS_MT_POSITION_X
abs 0x36 0 3119 10       # ABS_MT_POSITION_Y
wait 1080000            # 18 min: SpringBoard and the Home Screen under qemu (before `ready`: `repeat` does not wait again)
ready
swipe 720 3100 720 1500 300
wait 5000
tap 216 359
wait 40000
swipe 720 3100 720 1500 300
wait 5000
tap 552 359
wait 40000
swipe 720 3100 720 1500 300
wait 5000
tap 888 359
wait 40000
swipe 720 3100 720 1500 300
wait 5000
